00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:05.630
ANKIT SRIVASTAVA:
Thank you, Pritam.

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:06.520
Thank you, Priyanka.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:09.430
It was awesome to be here
and share our journey.

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:10.840
With Spanner as
a building block,

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:13.150
and a redesign of our
